#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:73
msgid "Use search filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:75
msgid ""
"The product catalog can be filtered using the search bar at the top of the "
"page or the sidebar on the side of the page."
msgstr "你可以使用頁面頂部的搜尋列或頁面側邊的側邊欄來篩選產品目錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:78
msgid ""
"To filter by product type, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in the search bar to open the "
"search menu. In the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section, select "
"the :guilabel:`Services` filter to only show service products or the "
":guilabel:`Goods` filter to only show physical products."
msgstr ""
"如要按產品類型篩選，請按一下搜尋列中的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(切換"
"搜尋面板)` 按鈕以開啟搜尋選單。在 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 區段"
"中，選擇 :guilabel:`服務` 篩選條件以僅顯示服務產品，或選擇 :guilabel:`貨品` "
"篩選條件以僅顯示實體產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:83
msgid ""
"When creating or configuring a quotation, an :guilabel:`In the Order` filter"
" appears in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section of the search "
"bar. Select this filter to only show products that have already been added "
"to the form."
msgstr ""
"建立或設定報價單時，系統會提供 :guilabel:`在訂單中` 篩選條件，位於搜尋列的 "
":icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選` 部分。選取此篩選條件，即可僅顯示已新增至表"
"單的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the sidebar on the side of the page, select an option in the :icon:`fa-"
"th-list` :guilabel:`Categories` section to filter by product category."
msgstr ""
"在頁面側邊欄的:icon:`fa-th-list` :guilabel:`類別`區域中選取一個選項，即可按產"
"品類別進行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:90
msgid "The filter sidebar in the product catalog."
msgstr "產品目錄中的篩選側邊欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:94
msgid "Add or remove a product from a record form"
msgstr "從記錄表單新增或移除產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:96
msgid ""
"This example uses a sales quotation. The UI may differ from what is pictured"
" depending on the apps and modules active on the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"此範例使用銷售報價單。實際介面可能會與圖中所示有所不同，視乎 Odoo 數據庫中已"
"啟用的應用程式及模組而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:99
msgid ""
"To add a product to a form, click on the product's card or the :icon:`fa-"
"shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add` button in the bottom corner of the card. "
"Doing so adds one unit of the product, which is displayed in a field in the "
"bottom corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"若要在表單中新增產品，請按一下產品卡片，或按一下卡片底角的:icon:`fa-shopping-"
"cart` :guilabel:`新增`按鈕。此操作會新增一個單位的產品，並顯示於卡片底角的欄"
"位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:103
msgid ""
"To adjust the quantity of the product added, click the :icon:`fa-minus` "
":guilabel:`(minus)` and :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` buttons to adjust"
" the quantity by one. Alternatively, a specific quantity can be entered by "
"typing it in manually. Clicking the product card additional times also "
"increases the product count with each click."
msgstr ""
"要調整已加入產品的數量，請點擊 :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(減號)` 及 "
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(加號)` 按鈕，逐一增減數量。你亦可手動輸入指定數量"
"。此外，每次重複點擊產品卡片亦會增加該產品的數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:108
msgid ""
"To remove a product from the order, either click the :icon:`fa-trash` "
":guilabel:`Remove` button in the bottom corner of the product card or click "
"the :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` button until the quantity is zero."
msgstr ""
"若要從訂單中移除產品，請點擊產品卡底部角落的 :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`移"
"除` 按鈕，或點擊 :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`（減號）` 按鈕，直至數量為零。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:112
msgid ""
"Once the desired quantity of each product has been reached, return to the "
"form by clicking the :guilabel:`Back to [X]` button at the top of the "
"screen. This button differs depending on the type of form being configured "
"(quotation, |BoM|, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:117
msgid ""
"Products appear in the product catalog and can be added to orders even if "
"there are zero units of the product on hand. As a result, it is important to"
" confirm the quantity of a product being added to an order is actually "
"available."
msgstr ""
"即使產品的現有數量為零，產品仍會出現在產品目錄中並可加入訂單。因此，務必確認"
"要加入訂單的產品數量確實可用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:122
msgid "Products with packaging options"
msgstr "設有包裝選項的產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:124
msgid ""
"For products with multiple packaging options, a drop-down menu appears when "
"that product is selected. Choosing a packaging option other than the default"
" displays both the cost for that package and the per-unit cost for the items"
" within it."
msgstr ""
"對於具有多種包裝選項的產品，選擇該產品時會顯示一個下拉式選單。若選擇預設以外"
"的包裝選項，系統會同時顯示該包裝的成本以及內含項目的每單位成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:128
msgid ""
"A product card with the packaging drop-down expanded and showing per-unit "
